// exercises the per-session latch: with `session_affinity` set, `classify_trigger`
// is NewSession and a second turn in the same session should reuse the first
// target instead of re-judging.
//
// Turn 2 scripts a decision response anyway; if the latch holds it stays
// unconsumed and `unconsumed_scripted` becomes 1, which is exactly the signal we
// want recorded.

